  "worked_solution": "We can find the volume $V$ of the rectangular prism using the formula\n\n$$\nV=lwh,\n$$\n\nwhere $l$ is the length, $w$ is the width, and $h$ is the height of the solid.\n\nSubstituting \n\n$$\nl=7\\,\\text{cm},\\,w=\\sqrt{5}\\,\\text{cm},\\,h=2\\sqrt{5}\\,\\text{cm}\n$$\n\ninto the formula, we obtain\n\n$$\nV=7\\cdot \\sqrt{5}\\cdot 2\\sqrt{5}=14\\sqrt{25}=70\\,{\\text{cm}}^{3}.\n$$",
